abstract: "Analysis code, derived five-minute ERCOT reserve panels and full-precision reference results for five ERCOT operating windows (Uri 2021, Elliott 2022, January 2025, February 2022 and July 2022). run_all.py regenerates every numerical table and analysis figure in a new directory and compares the results with the reference files. Code: MIT License; derived data: CC BY 4.0."
